      "value": "Aura of the Bulwark"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This aura will periodically drain a small amount of my mana in order to "
        },
        {
          "text": "apply an armor boosting effect to me and to those in close proximity to me",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". I can probably make stronger versions of this aura as I grow in strength and knowledge.\n\nDue to it being a particularly complicated magical construction, I can only place it on chest armor as it has enough space for all the rune work needed. It also likely won't work with any other aura, but should be compatible with most of the other enchantments."
        }
      ]
    }
